Package: zed
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd, libwayland-client0
Suggests: netcat-openbsd, clang, cmake, gnome-keyring
Description: high-performance multiplayer code editor
 Zed is a code editor from the creators of Atom and Tree-sitter. It
 renders with the GPU through Vulkan.
 .
 Repack of the upstream release from GitHub. It uses the system libraries.
 The editor does not update itself: apt installs the updates. The commands
 are zed and zeditor.
